   "text": "Trade-offs to raise\n\u2022 Orchestration vs choreography\n\u2022 Each step idempotent + retry policy\n\u2022 Timeouts and human waits\n\u2022 Saga compensation, not rollback\n\u2022 Visibility: find stuck runs",
